<title>SINGAPORE: Brunei cuts term Seria LIght, Champion $2.15.</title>
<headline>Brunei cuts term Seria LIght, Champion $2.15.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brunei has cut the term crude price of its Seria Light and Champion grades each by $2.15 per barrel to $19.20 and $19.00 respectively, industry sources said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>This compared with June prices of $21.35 for Seria Light and $21.15 for Champion, the sources said.</p>
<p>Brunei sets its term prices retroactively.</p>
<p>The August provisional price for Seria Light was set at $19.00 and the provisional price for Champion was set at $18.80.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65 870 3084)</p>
</text>
